ondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressions of Frequency with Daily Activities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adverbs and expressions of frequency to talk about daily activities.<br/>You use adverbs before the verb, like <span class = \"italic\">I occasionally have headaches.</span><br/>You use expressions after the verb, like <span class = \"italic\">I play soccer every other week.</span><br/>You can also use adverbs after the verb to be, like <span class = \"italic\">Pizza is always good</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Adverbs</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Expressions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always<br/>usually<br/>often<br/>sometimes<br/>occasionally<br/>hardly ever<br/>never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100% of the time <br/> 80% of the time <br/> 60% of the time <br/> 40% of the time <br/> 20% of the time <br/> 5% of the time <br/> 0% of the time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"every day/week/month<br/>most of the time<br/>every other day/week/month\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: How often do you play soccer?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: I play soccer every day."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Ann</span>: Do you like pizza?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: I hardly ever eat pizza."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "occasionally"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not often; from time to time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I occasionally play soccer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about daily activities."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "most of the time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very often; usually"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I eat at home most of the time."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "every other day"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "one day out of two"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I go to yoga class every other day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardly ever"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very rarely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hardly ever eat pizza."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glad"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "happy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm glad you like the food."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "conte